skill_requirements:
PM项目经理
职责描述：
•	业务职责：
- 有效掌控项目推进中各环节，协助项目组其他成员的工作，及时发现并处理项目推进中存在的风险；
- 参与项目跟进会议，了解项目进展情况，做好记录。并定期汇报；
- 组织对项目负责板块的环节交付物评审（包括：动员，业务模式制定，项目启动准备，项目启动，项目交付，项目关闭等）；
- 现场跟踪项目进度；
- 完成领导临时交办的其它工作任务；
•	管理职责：
- 对项目部分板块的进度负责，与客户及供应商协调具体事宜；
任职要求：
•	统招本科及以上学历，丰富的业内项目管理经验；
•	有外企工作背景；
•	英语六级，读写能力佳，口语流畅
•	具有处理突发问题、事件的能力和工作经验；
•	愿意根据项目情况，安排出差；
•	熟练操作办公软件，精通Excel、Word、Visio应用，具备较专业的PPT制作能力；
•	具有良好的客户沟通能力及团队写作能力，强烈的责任感及敬业精神

Project Manager
Job description：
• Business responsibilities:
-Effectively monitor and promote the project timeline, assist and coordinate other members of the project team, and timely identify and deal with the risks in the project;
-Participate in the project follow-up meeting, understand the project progress and make records. And report regularly;
-Organize user acceptance tests and audit the deliveries for each milestone (including mobilization of project team, business model formulation, project startup preparation, project startup, project delivery, project closure, etc.);
-Track the project progress on site;
-Complete other temporary tasks assigned by leaders;
• Management responsibilities:
-Be responsible for the progress of some parts of the project, and coordinate specific matters with customers and suppliers;

Job requirements:
• Bachelor degree or above, rich project management experience in the industry;
• Working experience in foreign company;
• CET-6, good reading and writing skills, fluent oral English
• Have the ability and working experience to deal with unexpected problems and events;
• Willing to arrange business trips according to the project situation;
• Proficient in office software, Excel, word and Visio applications, with professional ppt skills;
• Good customer communication skills and team writing skills, strong sense of responsibility and professionalism.
